# Frontend Conventions

## Structure

- One folder per component: `ComponentName/ComponentName.jsx` + `ComponentName.module.css`
- Pages live in `frontend/src/pages/`
- Board admin tools in `frontend/src/components/BoardPortal/subcomponents/`

## API calls

Import the shared base URL — never redefine it locally:

```javascript
import { API_URL } from "../../config"; // adjust relative path
const res = await fetch(`${API_URL}/api/announcements`);
```

## Styling

- CSS Modules for component styles
- Inline `style={{}}` exists in some modals — match surrounding pattern when editing

## Role gating (client-side only)

```javascript
const isAdmin = user?.role === "board_member" || user?.role === "super_admin";
```

Admin UI is hidden for non-admins but backend does not enforce this yet.
